        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"547f2d49-30ea-4371-974e-e16a2c3cb9a4\",\"review_text\":\"Love it!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"528dd087-1818-4c2e-9492-9d785b6eb2a6\",\"review_text\":\"My everyday partner for refreshing my mood...\"},{\"review_id\":\"afa8e5a5-d755-49cf-a123-59990e5bd367\",\"review_text\":\"Full time waste app never download this because more advertisement and adds i well recommend it to don't download this app it will waste your time it will play one than you will have to watch two adds 🤬🤬🤬😡😡😡😡😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"dea254c2-e80b-494d-9676-dd27c2ede6a1\",\"review_text\":\"A good choice if you are looking for a really good music-app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"90864cef-d24f-4ebf-a3c9-b5267483fcc1\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely not worth the time to download. So I downloaded this, spent the time to make a playlist. Today despite the fact I played my playlist spotify decided to play some random dude I never heard of. I didn't select my playlist because I didn't want to listen to it. It's like the people at Spotify had a meeting and asked for idea how to make their service as bad as possible. The winner was clearly not playing what people want to listen to.\"},{\"review_id\":\"989283f8-cd15-463d-acc7-063af6ac61dd\",\"review_text\":\"May add more songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"b51113df-1fde-4ec5-9e97-0f34ced1bfa4\",\"review_text\":\"Trash... their are better apps for free try them\"},{\"review_id\":\"e6826207-e6e6-46ec-bb39-e6cf66070c04\",\"review_text\":\"Will not play the songs I select. Keeps playing random songs from genres I do not like at all. What is the point of this app if it gives you random songs when you want to listen to a specific song. Unhelpful app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c34a6ce5-8f9a-49cd-8720-5645a8f0cbb5\",\"review_text\":\"Bests\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d94a5cf-406b-48d4-8b1e-6f52eddc08fd\",\"review_text\":\"My driving pal 💯👍🏻\"}]}"
